From 5e3a2a46feccedd7220959903d2927321e11c7e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ephico2real2 <ephico2real@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:51:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ztunnel/zds: reassert capture and require fresh enrollment
 acknowledgments

A failed DEL can leave the observed cache populated after capture was removed. Remove the cache shortcut so reenrollment reinstalls capture and sends ADD instead of returning a false success. Honor caller cancellation before filesystem work and retain installed capture on cancellation or metadata failure. Add workload UID and namespace to acknowledged-enrollment logs.

Local Linux ARM64 proof: a real namespace/iptables DEL-NACK regression fails before the change and passes after it. Full privileged/race suite, Go vet and repository lint pass. Snapshot identity quarantine, mandatory CNI admission and concurrent capture-removal ordering remain separate open gates. Tracks CMTC issue12; CI deferred.

Signed-off-by: ephico2real2 <ephico2real@gmail.com>
